      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Equality%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Near Equality lies the historic Crenshaw House, once a manor built by John Hart Crenshaw involved in the Reverse Underground Railroad.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
